[
  // What the three knowledge professions carry home. These are records, not power: a survey
  // chart is worth having because filing it raises Realm Knowledge, and a property dossier is
  // worth having because it is what an Assay Table consumes. Neither one ever appears in a
  // fabrication, which is the rule that keeps Cartography and Assay from quietly becoming
  // damage professions (docs/professions.md §19-20).
  //
  // Thieving's take is here too. It is deliberately *not* a currency — there is no economy yet
  // and inventing one for a breadth pass would be a fake resource. What a thief actually walks
  // away with is precious metal (already in minerals.json), a key, or somebody's paperwork.

